H'; test:67 assertion. Also readme-command.ts key lines: 69-70 (index 0 → initializeState), 177-183 (remove+recreate), 92 (env from state), 96 (runCommand with env), 115-118 (receipt environment), 192-203 (readmeCommandEnvironment), 291-297 (readState validation), 310-317 (persisted root). aspire-walk.ts:29 (env? param), 103 (env param), 112 (env passed), 86 (quickstart.walk unchanged 3-arg).\n\nSuite statePath shared: readme-quickstart-suite.ts:118 (resolve repoRoot '.llm/tmp/readme-quickstart/state.json'). Good.\n\nOnce the full test sweep returns, write the verdict file and print it. The output path: /home/agent/projects/netscript/worktrees/007-aspire/.llm/runs/.../impl-eval-verdict.md — in the sibling worktree. That's outside my worktree; writing there is explicitly instructed (it's the shared run dir where brief.md lives). I'll write it with the Write tool.\n\nLet me check the background test result now.","signature":""}],"model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","stop_reason":null,"stop_details":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":null,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"inference_geo":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null,"speed":"standard"},"provider":"GMICloud","context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"229add02-ca41-444b-82ba-387aaf5372ff","uuid":"4b1cccdc-da9a-43d5-bc39-ae702db0a011","timestamp":"2026-09-03T02:31:25.223Z","request_id":"gen-1788402623-b9feDHfHchsfaJzFWwII"}
